# Trial Of The Scholar (Q214), second part, played by a level 36 Human Wizard at cond 15 holding the second
# sigil and all but the last of each of Jurek's trophies (every script roll pinned to 1): Jurek's list is
# filled by the Monster Eye Destroyer, the Breka orc shaman and the two Shackles, and his symbol, which a
# level 36 traveller uses to skip Mirien's instruction, returns to Mirien for the third sigil; Cronos, Dieter,
# Creta, Dieter, Edroc, Raut and Triff pass on the letters, key and ring until Dieter holds the diary; then
# relog.
# Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
